Let’s install syft in our DevSecOps Box.
--------------------
curl -sSfL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anchore/syft/main/install.sh | sh -s -- -b /usr/local/bin v1.37.0

syft --help

Collecting SBOMs for a Python MCP Server
-----------------------
git clone https://gitlab.practical-devsecops.training/marudhamaran/cmcp-expenseapprover

cd cmcp-expenseapprover

syft scan
------------
syft scan dir:./

python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate

pip install -r requirements.txt

rescan
-------
syft scan dir:./

syft scan dir:./ | more

cat requirements.txt | wc -l

syft scan dir:./ -o json > cmcp-expenseapprover-sbom.json

jq '.artifacts | length' cmcp-expenseapprover-sbom.json

